    "prim-engine-execute",
    // prim: (method 10 prim-strip) (setup-dma-and-tex) is landed with a
    // real body and compiles clean under (mi) (Successfully built all 649
    // targets), but offline-test's own narrower compile context rejects
    // its raw (l.wu (+ ... 12)) read on *foreground-to-level-translate*
    // ("No method or function named l.wu for type int"), the same
    // environment gap collide-hash.gc's own collide-list-fill-bg-using-box
    // comment documents (offline-test does not exercise the full game.gp
    // rlet/macro environment).
